EmbedOR / ORC-ManL curvature-based embedding analysis
  src/eval/embedor.py is an independent clean-room reimplementation written from
  the papers and their public reference code (no source copied; neither upstream
  package declares a license). Ollivier-Ricci curvature is computed directly from
  its definition with POT (optimal transport) and scipy.
  Follows: Saidi et al., "EmbedOR: Provable Cluster-Preserving Visualizations
           with Curvature-Based Stochastic Neighbor Embeddings",
           arXiv:2509.03703 (2025).
           https://github.com/TristanSaidi/embedor
           Saidi et al., "Recovering Manifold Structure Using Ollivier-Ricci
           Curvature", ICLR 2025 / arXiv:2410.01149.
           https://github.com/TristanSaidi/orcml
